                "description": "As an authenticated user who is scope admin of scope A, send PATCH /api/business-scopes/<scopeA>/members/<membershipId-of-scope-B> with body {\"role\":\"admin\"} (or DELETE the same path). The requireScopeAccess('admin') guard authorizes on scopeA (path :id) and passes; updateMemberRole then updates the scope-B membership row directly. The same works for removal via DELETE.",
