            "text": "Session JWT accepted and propagated via ?token= query parameter\n\nThe authentication middleware accepts a full session JWT via the `?token=` query parameter on every authenticated route, and the frontend actively embeds it in URLs for iframes, file previews and downloads. Query strings are routinely captured in browser history, server/proxy access logs, and Referer headers, exposing a 24-hour-lived session token."
